    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for all expression AST nodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every concrete node type derives from <computeroutput><ref refid="structonnx__light_1_1onnx__optim_1_1expressions_1_1Node" kindref="compound">Node</ref></computeroutput> and overrides <computeroutput><ref refid="structonnx__light_1_1onnx__optim_1_1expressions_1_1Node_1a7e6e24c904914c6df5e4af6a4b0c5478" kindref="member">clone()</ref></computeroutput> to produce a deep copy. Nodes are always heap-allocated and owned by <computeroutput>NodePtr</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
